# <type>: <short summary, imperative, lowercase, no period, max ~72 chars>
#
# <body: what changed and why, wrapped at ~72 chars>
#
# Types:
#   feat     new feature
#   fix      bug fix
#   docs     documentation only
#   chore    tooling, config, housekeeping
#   refactor code change that neither fixes a bug nor adds a feature
#   test     adding or updating tests
#   ci       CI/CD pipelines (GitHub Actions)
#   build    build system, dependencies, Docker
#   style    formatting only, no code change
#   perf     performance improvement
#
# Example:
#   feat: add task state machine
#
#   Enforce valid transitions (DRAFT -> ASSIGNED -> IN_PROGRESS ->
#   SUBMITTED -> APPROVED/REJECTED) in the backend and reject invalid
#   ones with TASK_INVALID_TRANSITION.
#
# Lines starting with '#' are ignored.
